# Every case of "Modifications Not Staged For Commit" and "Untracked Files".
I definitions.inc
> init
<<<
+ a.txt wug.txt
+ b.txt wug.txt
+ c.txt wug.txt
+ d.txt wug.txt
> add a.txt
<<<
> add b.txt
<<<
> add c.txt
<<<
> add d.txt
<<<
> commit "four files"
<<<
# tracked, changed, not staged
+ a.txt notwug.txt
# tracked, deleted, not staged for removal
- b.txt
# staged for removal, then created again -> untracked
> rm c.txt
<<<
* c.txt
+ c.txt wug.txt
# staged for addition, then changed
+ e.txt wug.txt
> add e.txt
<<<
+ e.txt notwug.txt
# staged for addition, then deleted
+ f.txt wug.txt
> add f.txt
<<<
- f.txt
# never added
+ g.txt wug.txt
> status
=== Branches ===
\*master

=== Staged Files ===
e.txt
f.txt

=== Removed Files ===
c.txt

=== Modifications Not Staged For Commit ===
a.txt \(modified\)
b.txt \(deleted\)
e.txt \(modified\)
f.txt \(deleted\)

=== Untracked Files ===
c.txt
g.txt

<<<*
